<title>SWEDEN: SKF says Toyota deal could mean more order.</title>
<headline>SKF says Toyota deal could mean more order.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish rollerbearing maker AB SKF said on Thursday the deal it signed with Japanese vehicle maker Toyota Motor Corporation could well result in more orders for the Swedish company from Toyota.</p>
</text>
